":false,"text":"Script\n\n\nPart 1: Show Lion kit Jay kit and Holly kit besides Daisy zoom in on Holly kit and show “Don’t Make Me, A Complete Hollyleaf MAP, Hosted by Amber0169”\nPart 2: Show Holly kit opening her eyes and have Enjoy! in the center of the screen\nPart 3:Hollykit stands up onto her feet, looking around the nursery. Show Jay kit opening his eyes slightly, then blinking them open\nPart 4: Holly kit goes out of the nursery and into Thunder clan camp. Jay kit follows her with Lion kit by his side. Show Firestar on Highledge, a crowd of random cats( like 4 or 5)\nCluttered below him.(Include Squirrel flight in the crowd)\nPart 5:Hollykit blinks excited. She Lion kit and Jay kit sit by each other. Show Firestar smiling at them\nPart 6: Hollypaw recioves hor apprentice name. Show her and Leafpool sitting in the closing together.\nPart 7: Leafpool takes Holypaw to the medicine den, Leafpool smiling at Hollypaw slightly. The pair sits together in the medicine den.\nPart 8: Show a quick frame of Jaypaw sitting beside the moonpool, alone, Then show a picture of Hollypaw siting in the medicine den, gazing at some medicine herbs a bit sadly\nPart 9: Show Hollypaw and Jaypaw heading towards the leader's den. Show them entering the den, Firestar spinning around to meet their gaze. Firestar nods at the pair of cats.\nPart 10: Show a frame of Hollypaw in the forest with her new mentor, Brackenfur.The show Hollypaw crouch down in a fern bush, looking at a mouse in the distance, flash a quick white light and then show Hollypaw carrying the mouse\nPart 11 Show a couple of quick frames of Hollypaw hunting and training with Brackenfur Flash white and  then show her smiling and excited and sitting beside Lionpaw and Cinderpaw with a couple of cats around then show Firestar on Highledge\nPart 12 Hollyleaf Lionblaze and Cinderheart sat in front of the camp entrance doing their night vigil flash white and now show Thunderclan camp on fire\nPart 13: Jay feather Hollyleaf Lionblaze and Squirrelflight fleeing from the fire. Flash white and show the four cats surrounded by the fire\nPart 14: Flash white Show Ashfur  bursting through the flames glaring at Squirrelsflight  who looks at him in hope to save her kits but Ashfur shakes his head. Squirrelflight stares at him in horror \nPart 15; Ashfur smilas evily, pointing at Lionblaze, Jayteather and Hollyleat, Squirretlight Ip-syncs at Ashfur, Ashfur glares at Squirrelfight angrily, Hollyleaf binks in surprise, her yes filing up with tears.|\nPart 16: Flash white. Show Hollyleaf crouched low in the forest, locking at Ashfur in the distance. Flash white, Show Holly leaf springing at Ashfur, the two cats fighting. Flash white. Show Ashfur dead, lying in a stream. Hollyleaf looks at his body, sighing sadly.( Try to keep the gore minimal as possible)\nPart 17: Show Hollyleaf in the warriors' don, Ljonblaze, Brackenfur, and Cinderheart in the background, sloeping too. Flash white. Show Hollyloaf having nightmares of her killing Ashfur over and over again.\nPart 18:Hoilyioat lip-syncs, \"Don't make mo bo the bad guy!\" And wakos up in the warriors' don, Flash white. Show Hollyloaf confronting Loafpool, sip-syncing again. \"Don t nake me be the bad guyl\" Leafpool sighs sadly, looking at Holtyleat in the eyes. \nPart 19:  Hollyleaf stares at Leafpool in shock. She glares at her, her eyes filing up with tears. Then, she runs away into the forest.\nPart 20: Flash white. Show cats at the gathering. Firestar blinks at the crowd of random cats. (Be sure to include Leafpool, Squrrelfight, Hollyleat, and Crowfeather at the gathering) Holly leaf looks at Firestar who also looks at Hollyleaf\nPart 21: Show Hollyleaf lip-syncing throughout the whole part. Show frames of Leafpool crying with Squirrellight by her side, shedding a bit of tears too, but not as much. Show Crowfeather glaring at hollyleaf,screaming\nPart 22:   Flash white. Show Leafpool crying in the medicine den. Holyleaf appears from behind her in the entrance, shedding a tear. Leafpool turns around to face her daughter.\nPart 23:  Show Hoilyleaf lip-syncing at Leafpool. Leafpool stares at Hollyleaf, crying. Hollyleat pushes a bundle of deathberries to Leafpool, nodding at her and frowning.\nPart 24: Leafpool looks at Hollyleaf sadly, shaking her head. Hollyleaf screams at Leafpool. Suddenly Jayfeather and Lionblaze came in and she turns around to face them anger filling her eyes\nPart 25: Hollyleaf stares at hor brothers in horror, running past them and out of the medicine den. Lionblaze calls her to come back, but Hollyloaf keeps on running.\nPart 26: Jayfeather sheds a tear, and he and Lionblaze run aftor Hollyleaf. Show Hollyleaf making her way towards the tunnels, shedding tears.\nPart 27: Jayteather and Lionblaze cry after her, but Hollyleaf keeps on going. Show frames of Jayfeather crying, and then Lionblaze crying \nPart 28: Hollyleaf runs into the tunnels, looking at her brothers in horror. She lip-syncs, \"No, don't make me be the bad  guy!”\nPart 29: Lionblaze finches, pointing at the tunnels. Hollyloaf wipes away her tears and looks up. Her fur puffs up, and she lips syncs\nPart 30:Shows Holl leaf going deeper into the tunnels\nPart 31: Rocks begin to fall. The entrance to the tunnel is almost blocked, and Hollyleaf lip-syncs at her brothers, \"Don't make me be the bad guy-“\nPart 32: The tunnel has fully collapsed, snow Lionblaze screaming and Jayfeather shedding tears. Then, show end on the center of the  screen "},"=Coow!iwWR`{9RN]?^#R":{"blockId":null,"x":293,"y":-224,"width":137,"height":96,"minimized":false,"text":"Codeword is Holly"}},"currentCostume":0,"costumes":[{"name":"Thumbnail","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"99d1af51fc38a1b53b3abd95a7e21faf","md5ext":"99d1af51fc38a1b53b3abd95a7e21faf.png","rotationCenterX":480,"rotationCenterY":360},{"name":"backdrop1","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"9b57c0cae3938b33d259b19cb561a7c1","md5ext":"9b57c0cae3938b33